      "pointerRules": [
        "每次Candidate Publication在同一事务读取current head、执行`current → current+1` CAS并把Package/Receipt revision固定为新head，Planner/Work/Draft不得预分配revision或要求兄弟Candidate按Structure ordinal提交"
      ]
