    "jsonContracts": [],
    "immutability": {
      "immutable": false,
      "rules": [
        "Run及其`proc_run_materials` immutable basis列共同构成完整Basis，禁止只凭digest恢复",
        "Field Access/Profile Hint/Observation/Policy均显式FK，`(field_id,profile_hint_revision)`指向immutable Hint revision且三项Hint列必须逐字节一致",
        "Triage tuple必须由`ProcurementTriageRuleRegistry@1`当前active entry签发，Admission时验证active，历史恢复时验证精确immutable entry仍存在且digest匹配，不建立调用者可写Rule表",
        "sealed时Decision ID/digest、Outcome、Evidence digest、finished time与Seal marker/result必须同时非NULL且写后immutable，非sealed时全部NULL，`UNIQUE(seal_decision_id) WHERE seal_decision_id IS NOT NULL`"
      ]
    },
    "deletion": {
      "foreignKeyPolicy": "ON DELETE RESTRICT",
      "rules": []
    },
    "semanticRules": [
      "`run_basis_schema_ref=ProcurementRunExecutionBasis@1`",
      "`selected_material_count=1..1024`，`selection_scope_count=1..selected_material_count`且Scope set digest可由`proc_run_materials`唯一重建",
      "Run及其`proc_run_materials` immutable basis列共同构成完整Basis，禁止只凭digest恢复",
      "Field Access/Profile Hint/Observation/Policy均显式FK，`(field_id,profile_hint_revision)`指向immutable Hint revision且三项Hint列必须逐字节一致",
      "Admission还要求terminal Observation冻结同一Hint Snapshot",
      "Triage tuple必须由`ProcurementTriageRuleRegistry@1`当前active entry签发，Admission时验证active，历史恢复时验证精确immutable entry仍存在且digest匹配，不建立调用者可写Rule表",
      "初始`state_revision=1,candidate_package_revision_head=0`",
      "每次Candidate Publication在同一事务读取current head、执行`current → current+1` CAS并把Package/Receipt revision固定为新head，Planner/Work/Draft不得预分配revision或要求兄弟Candidate按Structure ordinal提交",
      "只有该transaction-local CAS可改变head",
      "sealed时Decision ID/digest、Outcome、Evidence digest、finished time与Seal marker/result必须同时非NULL且写后immutable，非sealed时全部NULL，`UNIQUE(seal_decision_id) WHERE seal_decision_id IS NOT NULL`",
      "`UNIQUE(field_id,run_basis_digest)`禁止同一Basis建立第二个Run，Retry Basis因包含唯一`sourceRetryIntentId`形成新digest",
      "`retry_intent_id`为空或唯一引用一次性Intent并加`UNIQUE(retry_intent_id) WHERE retry_intent_id IS NOT NULL`",
      "Admission/Seal marker各自唯一且显式FK",
      "Retry建立的Run与Intent共享同一consume/admission marker和outer result digest",
      "Supporting Work通过`owner_domain+process_type+process_id`关联",
      "`INDEX(state,priority_class,created_at_ms)`"
    ],
    "rawContract": {
      "columns": "`procurement_run_id PK, field_id FK, run_basis_schema_ref, access_revision, access_digest, content_profile_hint, profile_hint_revision, profile_hint_digest, terminal_observation_revision, field_observation_work_id, extraction_policy_id, extraction_policy_revision, extraction_policy_digest, triage_rule_ref, triage_rule_revision, triage_rule_schema_ref, triage_rule_digest, triage_rule_authority_digest, run_basis_digest, selected_material_count, selection_scope_count, selection_scope_set_digest, retry_intent_id NULL, state(active|waiting|sealed), state_revision, candidate_package_revision_head, seal_outcome NULL, seal_decision_id NULL, seal_decision_digest NULL, seal_evidence_digest NULL, admission_commit_marker, admission_result_digest, seal_commit_marker NULL, seal_result_digest NULL, priority_class, created_at_ms, finished_at_ms NULL`",
      "constraints": "`run_basis_schema_ref=ProcurementRunExecutionBasis@1`；`selected_material_count=1..1024`，`selection_scope_count=1..selected_material_count`且Scope set digest可由`proc_run_materials`唯一重建；Run及其`proc_run_materials` immutable basis列共同构成完整Basis，禁止只凭digest恢复；Field Access/Profile Hint/Observation/Policy均显式FK，`(field_id,profile_hint_revision)`指向immutable Hint revision且三项Hint列必须逐字节一致；Admission还要求terminal Observation冻结同一Hint Snapshot；Triage tuple必须由`ProcurementTriageRuleRegistry@1`当前active entry签发，Admission时验证active，历史恢复时验证精确immutable entry仍存在且digest匹配，不建立调用者可写Rule表；初始`state_revision=1,candidate_package_revision_head=0`；每次Candidate Publication在同一事务读取current head、执行`current → current+1` CAS并把Package/Receipt revision固定为新head，Planner/Work/Draft不得预分配revision或要求兄弟Candidate按Structure ordinal提交；只有该transaction-local CAS可改变head；sealed时Decision ID/digest、Outcome、Evidence digest、finished time与Seal marker/result必须同时非NULL且写后immutable，非sealed时全部NULL，`UNIQUE(seal_decision_id) WHERE seal_decision_id IS NOT NULL`；`UNIQUE(field_id,run_basis_digest)`禁止同一Basis建立第二个Run，Retry Basis因包含唯一`sourceRetryIntentId`形成新digest；`retry_intent_id`为空或唯一引用一次性Intent并加`UNIQUE(retry_intent_id) WHERE retry_intent_id IS NOT NULL`；Admission/Seal marker各自唯一且显式FK；Retry建立的Run与Intent共享同一consume/admission marker和outer result digest；Supporting Work通过`owner_domain+process_type+process_id`关联；`INDEX(state,priority_class,created_at_ms)`"
    },
